{"id":"654921","name":"煮肉丝拌菠菜","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/654921/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菠菜","amount":"300g"},{"name":"煮肉","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"温开水","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"菠菜洗净。","img":"images/654921/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切段。","img":"images/654921/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"取麻酱。","img":"images/654921/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放温开水化开后放食盐。","img":"images/654921/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放鸡精。","img":"images/654921/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放陈醋。","img":"images/654921/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放生抽。","img":"images/654921/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放香油。","img":"images/654921/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅和均匀。","img":"images/654921/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大蒜处理干净切末，放麻汁里。","img":"images/654921/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煮熟的外脊肉撕成条，我煮的时间久了，肉太烂乎，手撕不出来肉丝了。","img":"images/654921/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"锅烧开水，放菠菜焯水。","img":"images/654921/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"煮开锅即可。","img":"images/654921/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"捞出过冷水。","img":"images/654921/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"撰干水分放麻汁里。","img":"images/654921/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放肉条。","img":"images/654921/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/654921/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/654921/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}